{"sections":[{"slug":"非分歧的局部环同态","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"非分歧的局部环同态"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">非分歧的局部环同态</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“非分歧的局部环同态”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">称局部环同态</span> $f\\colon A\\to B$ <span lang=\"zh\">非分歧是指如下等价的条件之一成立</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$B/f(\\mathfrak m_A)B$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $A/\\mathfrak m_A$ <span lang=\"zh\">的有限可分扩域</span>;</li>\n<li>$f(\\mathfrak m_A)B=\\mathfrak m_B$, <span lang=\"zh\">且</span> $B/\\mathfrak m_B$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $A/\\mathfrak m_A$ <span lang=\"zh\">的有限可分扩域</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/非分歧概形态射","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">非分歧概形态射</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}